            "target_entity_instance": "Weddell sea",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "At the edge of the broad continental shelves of the southern Weddell and Ross seas and along the Adelie Land coast, ISW mixes with CDW and HSSW to form Antarctic Bottom Water (Foldvik et al., 1985; Williams et al., 2008) that contributes to the global overturning circulation.",
